python3 (3.14.7-17) stable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild the project as a standalone shared CPython runtime.
  * Replace Python.framework linkage with an rpath-based libpython dylib.
  * Use an accurate iOS 14.5 arm64 target and wheel platform tag.
  * Update TLS to OpenSSL 3.5.8 LTS and use the system CA store.
  * Enable jailbroken-device subprocesses through posix_spawn.
  * Remove debug entitlements and framework-only build workarounds.

